{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-job-29-1","title":"Job 29:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Job bemoans his former prosperity.</p>\n<p>continued. Heb. added to take up. 27:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-2","title":"Job 29:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>as in months. 1:1-5; 7:3 God. 1:10; Ps 37:28; Jude 1:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-3","title":"Job 29:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>candle. or, lamp. 18:6; 21:17; Ps 18:28; Pr 13:9; 20:20; 24:20 by his light. 22:28; Ps 4:6; 23:4; 27:1; 84:11; Isa 2:4; Joh 8:12; 12:46 Eph 5:8,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-4","title":"Job 29:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>the secret. 1:10; 15:8; Ps 25:14; 27:5; 91:1; Pr 3:32; Col 3:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-5","title":"Job 29:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>the Almighty. 23:3,8-10; De 33:27-29; Jos 1:9; Jud 6:12,13; Ps 30:7; 43:2; 44:8,9 So 2:4; 3:1,2; Jer 14:8; Mt 9:15 my children. 1:2-5; 42:13-16; Ps 127:3-5; 128:3; Pr 17:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-6","title":"Job 29:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>I washed. 20:17; Ge 49:11; De 32:13; 33:24; Ps 81:16 me out. Heb. with me.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-7","title":"Job 29:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>De 16:18; 21:19; Ru 4:1,2,11; Zec 8:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-8","title":"Job 29:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>young men. Le 19:32; Pr 16:31; 20:8; Ro 13:3,4; Tit 3:1; 1Pe 5:5 the aged. Ro 13:7; 1Pe 2:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-9","title":"Job 29:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>refrained. 4:2; 7:11; Pr 10:19; Jas 1:19 laid. 21:5; 40:4; Jud 18:19; Pr 30:32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-10","title":"Job 29:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>nobles held their peace. Heb. voice of the nobles was hid.their tongue. Ps 137:6; Eze 3:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-11","title":"Job 29:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>the ear. 31:20; Pr 29:2; Lu 4:22; 11:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-12","title":"Job 29:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>I delivered. 22:5-9; Ne 5:2-13; Ps 72:12; 82:2-4; Pr 21:13; 24:11,12; Jer 22:16 the fatherless. Ex 22:22-24; De 10:18; Ps 68:5; Jas 1:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-13","title":"Job 29:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>The blessing. De 24:13; Ac 9:39-41; 2Co 9:12-14; 2Ti 1:16-18 ready. 31:19; De 26:5; Pr 31:6-9; Isa 27:13 I caused. De 16:11; Ne 8:10-12; Phm 1:7 sing. Ps 67:4; Isa 65:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-14","title":"Job 29:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>I put. De 24:13; Ps 132:9; Isa 59:17; 61:10; Ro 13:14; 2Co 6:7; Eph 6:14 1Th 5:8; Re 19:8 a diadem. Isa 28:5; 62:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-15","title":"Job 29:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>eyes. Nu 10:31; Mt 11:5; 1Co 12:12-31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-16","title":"Job 29:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>a father. 31:18; Es 2:7; Ps 68:5; Eph 5:1; Jas 1:27 the cause. Ex 18:26; De 13:14; 17:8-10; 1Ki 3:16-28; Pr 25:2; 29:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-17","title":"Job 29:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>I brake. Ps 3:7; 58:8; Pr 30:14 jaws. Heb. jaw teeth, or grinders. and plucked. Heb. andcast. 1Sa 17:35; Ps 124:3,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-18","title":"Job 29:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>I shall die. Ps 30:6,7; Jer 22:23; 49:16; Ob 1:4; Hab 2:9 multiply. 5:26; 42:16,17; Ps 91:16 as the sand. Ge 32:12; 41:49</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-19","title":"Job 29:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>root. 18:16; Ps 1:3; Jer 17:8; Ho 14:5-7 spread out. Heb. opened.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-20","title":"Job 29:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>glory. 14; 19:9; Ge 45:13; Ps 3:3 fresh. Heb. new. my bow. Ge 49:24 renewed. Heb. changed. Ps 103:5; Isa 40:31; 2Co 4:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-21","title":"Job 29:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>gave ear. 9,10; 32:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-22","title":"Job 29:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>After my. 32:15,16; 33:31-33; Isa 52:15; Mt 22:46 speech. De 32:2; So 4:11; Eze 20:46; Am 7:16; Mic 2:6; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-23","title":"Job 29:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>as for the rain. Ps 72:6 the latter rain. Ho 6:3; Zec 10:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-24","title":"Job 29:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>they believed. Ge 45:26; Ps 126:1; Lu 24:41 the light. Ps 4:6; 89:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-29-25","title":"Job 29:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":29,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":29,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>chose out. Ge 41:40; Jud 11:8; 2Sa 5:2; 1Ch 13:1-4 dwelt. Ge 14:14-17; De 33:5 one that. 4:3,4; Isa 35:3,4; 61:1-3; 2Co 1:3,4; 7:5-7; 1Th 3:2,3</p>"}]}